d conflating unimplemented or unauthorized remote capabilities with failed local governance.\n\nThis PR establishes the current evidence baseline and corrects the execution boundary:\n\n- previous governance work was local-only\n- no remote Supabase write was authorized\n- RAG 1.1 was not implemented\n- no full external-VLM remediation is authorized at this stage\n\n## Remediation posture documented here\n\n- run only a paid 12-sample C0 external VLM canary\n- expand only after C0 passes, to a bounded 60-row E1 partial repair\n- pause paid expansion after E1 and freeze the same 72-row replay pool\n- qualify the future local VLM on L0/L1 before discussing full repair\n- keep C2 (600 rows) and C3 (3,530 rows) frozen pending explicit authorization\n- keep remote Supabase, Storage, Vector, RAG 1.1, and production cutover out of scope\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n  - report/artifact registration guard: healthy\n  - added report Markdown: 3\n  - violations: 0\n  - worktree: clean\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`: passed\n- relative Markdown link audit: passed for all 4 changed files\n- `git log origin/main..HEAD`: exactly 1 docs commit\n- no external VLM calls were made and no provider cost was incurred\n","created_at":"2026-07-10T08:29:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T08:31:27Z","closed_at":"2026-07-10T08:29:58Z","merged_at":"2026-07-10T08:29:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"53a4d38899f1ab46a4c39ec9e815c924d0c673e7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1530/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1530/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1530/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/re